  "meta": {
    "id": "community-nursing-home",
    "name": {
      "zh": "社区养老院（病房-走廊-护士站种子场景）",
      "en": "Community nursing home (ward + corridor + nurse-station seed scenario)"
    },
    "description": {
      "zh": "单层社区养老院种子场景（平面 20×10m，坐标单位=米，x 右/y 下，原点左上）：3 间双人病房 + 护士站 + 走廊 + 活动室，室外经围护与走廊耦合。照护链路全线预置：每床心率手环与跌倒检测手表（可穿戴）、床头呼叫器与离床传感垫（照护）、护士站呼叫接收主机；照护监测员只感知、不执行，异常必须经 AC 协作请动值班护士与环境管家。作息：7:00 起床查房、9:00 活动室早操、12:30 午休、15:00 下午茶、21:00 就寝；病房与活动室带声明式 occupantSchedule（病房 12:30–15:00 午休 2 人、活动室 9:00–12:30 早操 15 人）。异常剧本：14:00 102 房跌倒（critical，需 fall-detection + emergency-response 协作）、16:00 103 房午后升温（33°C）、16:30 走廊烟雾（high）、22:30 101 房离床（夜间 high）。验证点：跌倒/离床事件触发照护监测员→值班护士的协作提案；病房升温经邻接走廊缓慢扩散；烟雾事件联动环境管家与护士；内嵌 Flow 在 16:00 升温剧本处确定性触发 103 房自动降温。（v2 刷新：内嵌 2 条确定性 Flow）",
      "en": "Single-storey community nursing home seed (20×10m footprint, units=meters, x right / y down, origin top-left): 3 double wards + nurse station + corridor + day room; the outdoors couples to the corridor through the envelope. The care chain is pre-deployed: per-bed heart-rate wristbands and fall-detection watches, bedside call buttons and off-bed sensor pads, and the nurse-station call receiver; the care monitor is sense-only, so anomalies must rally the duty nurse and environment butler through AC collaboration. Daily rhythm: 07:00 wake-up rounds, 09:00 morning exercise, 12:30 lunch rest, 15:00 afternoon tea, 21:00 bedtime; wards and the day room carry declarative occupant schedules (wards 12:30–15:00 rest ×2, day room 09:00–12:30 exercise ×15). Anomaly script: 14:00 fall in Ward 102 (critical, fall-detection + emergency-response collaboration), 16:00 Ward 103 afternoon heat rise (33°C), 16:30 corridor smoke (high), 22:30 off-bed in Ward 101 (nighttime high). Verification points: fall/off-bed events trigger care-monitor → duty-nurse collaboration proposals; ward heat diffuses slowly through adjacent corridors; smoke orchestrates butler and nurse; the embedded flow deterministically cools Ward 103 when the 16:00 heat script lands. (v2 refresh: 2 embedded deterministic flows)"
    },
    "tagline": {
      "zh": "14:00，102 房跌倒告警——只有感知能力的监测员如何请动护士与管家跨角色救援",
      "en": "14:00, a fall alert in Room 102 — how a sense-only monitor agent rallies the nurse and butler across roles."
    },
    "heroEventId": "fall-102",
    "recommendedPlaybackRate": 30,
    "storeyHeight": 3.0
  },
